    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">There are <var>card_count</var> cards in a fixed order.<br><br>Each card has a letter on the front and a letter on the back.<br><br>The string <var>front</var> contains the front letters of the cards.<br>The string <var>back</var> contains the back letters in the same order.<br><br>At the beginning, all cards show their front side.<br><br>Read the <var>calls</var> from left to right.<br><br>For each called letter, flip every card that is currently showing that letter.<br><br>Each card can be flipped only once for the same call, even if both sides have the same letter.<br><br>Only the letter currently visible on a card matters. The hidden letter does not affect the current call.<br><br>After all calls, print <var>visible_faces</var>, the visible letters in card order.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> Two space-separated integers <var>card_count</var> and <var>call_count</var>.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> A string <var>front</var> of <var>card_count</var> lowercase letters.<br><strong>Line 3:</strong> A string <var>back</var> of <var>card_count</var> lowercase letters.<br><strong>Line 4:</strong> A string <var>calls</var> of <var>call_count</var> lowercase letters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A string <var>visible_faces</var> of <var>card_count</var> letters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>1</const> &lt;= <var>card_count</var>, <var>call_count</var> &lt;= <const>100</const><br><var>front</var>, <var>back</var>, and <var>calls</var> contain only <const>a</const> through <const>z</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">4 2\nabca\nbcab\nab</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">acca</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
